{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Prepares for Final Exams"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Great Sounding Board"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe plans for the organization of events."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le10ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for and Giving Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are many ways to ask for and to give advice."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What should I do?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should try to maintain as many routines as you can."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some expressions you can use to ask for and to give advice."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do you suggest?</p>  How do you suggest I ... ?</p>  Do you have any advice for ... ?</p>  What should I do?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's good to ...</p>  I strongly advise \u2026</p>  Why don't you \u2026</p>  You should try to \u2026</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Permission"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you ask for permission, it is important to be polite."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You often use a modal like <span class=\"italic\">can</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">could</span> to ask for permission.</p>  You can also ask a Yes or No question like <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIs it OK if \u2026\u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cWould you mind if \u2026\u201d</span></p>  Here are some ways to ask for and give permission."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Permission\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Permission\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I tell you about my problems?</p>   Would you mind if I asked a question?</p>  Can I take that course next term?</p>  Could I use your textbook this evening?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure, go ahead.</p>  Not at all. I'd be happy to help.</p> Yes, you can.</p> OK, no problem.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to balance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put the same amount of importance on two or more things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm having a hard time balancing my work and part-time studies. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to give advice about school."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "studies"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "courses or program of study"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My studies are very demanding this term. I have five courses."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "statistics"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the study of probability (a branch of mathematics)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Next term I have to take Statistics!  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "music appreciation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a course about how the history and styles of music"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Music Appreciation is an easy course."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to skip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to miss; to not do something you usually do"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Don't skip your workouts at the gym.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to circulate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move around (often blood in the body)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Just walk around the room to get the blood circulating."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to maintain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to keep in the same way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should try to maintain your daily routines. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sounding board"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who listens to a person talking about their problems"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thanks for the help. You're a great sounding board! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob09aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ask 4 - 6 people the question: <span class=\"italic\">Is it difficult to balance work and studies? </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask the person to give a reason."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the responses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a summary of your results."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your results to the class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I survey 4- 6 people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I count answers and reasons."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present the results."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le10ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le10ob09re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le10ob09re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Hi Vanessa!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey Peter, how's it going?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Not very well. Can I tell you about my problems?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure, go ahead.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm having a hard time balancing my work with part-time studies.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's a common problem.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le10ob09re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I feel stressed. I'm taking HR and Accounting courses. They're not easy, like English, Spanish or Music Appreciation. Next term I have to take Statistics!  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, that's hard.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I don't get enough sleep, and I make more mistakes that I should.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh Peter, everyone expects mistakes from you.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What should I do?", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "image": "engenn5le10ob09re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should try to maintain your daily routines. Don't skip your workouts at the gym. Take lots of shorts breaks. Just walk around the room to get the blood circulating.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, Vanessa! That's great advice. You're a great sounding board!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Anytime, my friend!", "id": 3, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn5le10ob09re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about subjects to study."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can ask for and give permission."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can ask for and respond to advice."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Is it difficult to balance work and studies? Why?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Who do you talk to when you have problems at work or with your studies"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Can I tell you about my problems?"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "selecte